    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826200/extras/7f2c790e57e4c96b67ea43e9908e74f5.avif?t=1736516991\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826200/extras/8b122599864afbf63d59940febaee6a0.avif?t=1736516991\" /></div><br><br>BeetleQuest 2 is a point &amp; click adventure game about three beetlefriends who go on their second adventure.<br><br>Join Dagmar, Magnus and Boris on a quest to help the beetle witch Frigga get back her magic spell. Someone has gotten into her cottage and stolen her spell that brings things to life, and the thief is using it everywhere!<br><br>Now, all across the land things are coming alive, causing all kinds of mayhem!<br><br>Search for the magic spell in forests and hills, in dark caves, snowy mountains, and even in a spooky castle. Solve puzzles on the way and meet with strange and friendly, or not so friendly, creatures. <br><br>So strap on your backpack and prepare your wits, and get ready for an adventure of epic beetleness!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A series of adventures</h2><br>BeetleQuest 2 is the second game in the BeetleQuest series.",
